OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas scam attempt leaves
OL,4,Ahotel staff appalled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre hotel has said it is
OL,7,F"appalled" after bogus emails were sent
OL,8,Finviting businesses to book stalls at a
OL,9,Fseries of Christmas fairs.
OL,11,FThe Assembly House in Norwich warned
OL,12,Fbusinesses, artists and independent
OL,13,Ftraders of someone trying to extract
OL,14,Fmoney with the false promise of stall
OL,15,Fspace at its fairs on 22 and 29
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FOn social media, a spokesperson said:
OL,19,F"We are appalled that someone would use
OL,20,Four name in this way and potentially
OL,21,Fexploit hard-working independent
OL,22,Fbusinesses."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
