OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas scam attempt leaves
OL,4,Ahotel staff appalled
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, the organisers of the
OL,7,FNorwich Global Village Market also said
OL,8,Ffraudsters had appeared to impersonate
OL,9,Fthem in the same way.
